<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Ah, yes, that's right: before we talk, there is something I would like you to note.<PG>
As I would still like you to keep reading the scenarios actively too, the topics will be limited to some extent according to your progress.<PG>
If you find you enjoy talking with me, then by all means, please advance the scenarios as well.<PG>
I expect the chatter topics will increase too.<PG>
{}
